;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Frootslogo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75\"/></a><ul class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\"><li><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors text-roots-text font-medium hover:text-roots-primary\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors text-roots-text font-medium hover:text-roots-primary\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li><li class=\"relative group py-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\"><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 text-roots-text font-medium hover:text-roots-primary\" href=\"/impact/agriculture\">Impact Hub<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors text-roots-text font-medium hover:text-roots-primary\" href=\"/governance\">Governance</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm transition-colors text-roots-text font-medium hover:text-roots-primary\" href=\"/news\">News and Insights</a></li></ul><a class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 bg-roots-primary text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\" href=\"/partner\">Partner With Us</a><button class=\"md:hidden p-2 text-roots-text hover:text-roots-primary transition-colors focus:outline-none cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></nav><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"bg-roots-beige min-h-screen text-left\"><section class=\"relative aspect-[21/11] flex  overflow-hidden w-full\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><img alt=\"Skills Hero\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero1.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero1.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero1.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero1.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero1.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero1.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero1.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/40 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto p-5 md:p-15 \"><div class=\"w-[clamp(16rem,40vw,32rem)] pb-10\"><h1 class=\"text-[clamp(1.25rem,4vw,3.75rem)] font-bold text-white leading-[1.15]  mb-6 tracking-wide\">Skill Development</h1><p class=\"text-[clamp(0.775rem,1.5vw,1.125rem)] text-white leading-relaxed font-light \">We support women and youth with practical, market-linked skills that connect training to livelihood opportunities.</p></div></div></section><section class=\" p-8 md:p-10  w-full\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mb-4 md:mb-0 md:mr-8\"><img src=\"/skills/icon1/1.svg\" alt=\"Banner Icon\" class=\"w-24 h-24 object-contain\"/></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-4 md:mb-0 md:mr-8 whitespace-nowrap\">Production-linked skilling centre</h2><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed\">Enabling women to train through live orders and hands-on production work</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"mb-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/skills/icon1/2.svg\" alt=\"₹12 lakh in production value\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-3\">₹12 lakh in production value</h3><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm leading-relaxed\">Secured through work orders linked to the Unnati Centre</p></div><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"mb-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/skills/icon1/3.svg\" alt=\"6+ brand collaborations\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-3\">6+ brand collaborations</h3><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm leading-relaxed\">Built for product development, production, and artisan-led engagement</p></div><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"mb-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/skills/icon1/4.svg\" alt=\"Textile-based training\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-3\">Textile-based training</h3><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm leading-relaxed\">Delivered in sewing, embroidery, textile production, and related skills</p></div><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"mb-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/skills/icon1/5.svg\" alt=\"Artisan-led workshops\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-3\">Artisan-led workshops</h3><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm leading-relaxed\">Conducted through hands-on textile, upcycling, embroidery, and product creation activities</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 sm:px-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#2a2a2a] uppercase tracking-widest\">OUR FOCUS AREAS</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[220px] bg-[#afafaf] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Focus Area 0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus1%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] text-center border border-roots-skilled p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-roots-text mb-3\">Market-Linked Skilling</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-roots-text leading-relaxed\">Connecting training with real production and work opportunities.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[220px] bg-[#afafaf] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Focus Area 1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" da