3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F6.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"group relative h-28 sm:h-32 overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Women entrepreneurs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 50vw, (max-width: 1024px) 25vw, 14vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Funnati%2F7.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative aspect-[21/11] flex  overflow-hidden w-full\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"><img alt=\"skills  Hero\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero2.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero2.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero2.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero2.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero2.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Fhero2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/40 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto p-5 md:p-15 \"><div class=\"w-[clamp(16rem,40vw,32rem)] pb-10\"> <h1 class=\"text-[clamp(1.25rem,4vw,3.75rem)] font-bold text-white leading-[1.15]  mb-6 tracking-wide\">Community Development</h1><p class=\"text-[clamp(0.775rem,1.5vw,1.125rem)] text-white leading-relaxed font-light \">We work with communities to strengthen access to healthcare, education, livelihoods, infrastructure, inclusion, and shared public resources.</p></div></div></section><section class=\" p-8 md:p-10  w-full\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 mb-4 md:mb-0 md:mr-8\"><img src=\"/skills/icon2/1.svg\" alt=\"Banner Icon\" class=\"w-24 h-24 object-contain\"/></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-4 md:mb-0 md:mr-8 whitespace-nowrap\">30 students</h2><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed\">Supported through scholarships and education continuity initiatives</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"mb-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/skills/icon2/2.svg\" alt=\"32.5-acre lake\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-3\">32.5-acre lake</h3><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm leading-relaxed\">Rejuvenated to restore ecological and community value</p></div><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"mb-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/skills/icon2/3.svg\" alt=\"~2 km road\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-3\">~2 km road</h3><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm leading-relaxed\">Renovated to improve connectivity and daily commute for local residents</p></div><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"mb-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/skills/icon2/4.svg\" alt=\"2 states\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-3\">2 states</h3><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm leading-relaxed\">Community development programmes implemented across Karnataka and Tamil Nadu</p></div><div class=\"bg-white flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"mb-4 h-20 flex items-center justify-center\"><img src=\"/skills/icon2/5.svg\" alt=\"2 rural clinics\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain\"/></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-roots-skilled mb-3\">2 rural clinics</h3><p class=\"text-roots-text text-sm leading-relaxed\">Healthcare consultations, preventive care, and wellness support enabled in rural communities</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 px-6 sm:px-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#2a2a2a] uppercase tracking-widest\">OUR FOCUS AREAS</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[220px] bg-[#afafaf] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Focus Area 0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg1.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] text-center border border-roots-skilled p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-roots-text mb-3\">Community Infrastructure</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-roots-text leading-relaxed\">Creating safer, more usable assets for local communities.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[220px] bg-[#afafaf] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Focus Area 1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] text-center border border-roots-skilled p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-roots-text mb-3\">Rural Healthcare Access</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-roots-text leading-relaxed\">Enabling primary care, preventive services, and wellness support.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[220px] bg-[#afafaf] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Focus Area 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg3.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] text-center border border-roots-skilled p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-roots-text mb-3\">Education and Digital Learning</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-roots-text leading-relaxed\">Supporting scholarships, digital literacy, and community learning.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[220px] bg-[#afafaf] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Focus Area 3\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg4.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] text-center border border-roots-skilled p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-roots-text mb-3\">Disability Inclusion</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-roots-text leading-relaxed\">Improving mobility, independence, and access to public life.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[220px] bg-[#afafaf] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Focus Area 4\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg5.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] text-center border border-roots-skilled p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-roots-text mb-3\">Livelihoods and SHG Engagement</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-roots-text leading-relaxed\">Strengthening income pathways through skills and group enterprise.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-full min-h-[220px] bg-[#afafaf] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Focus Area 5\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fskills%2Ffocus2%2Fimg6.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] text-center border border-roots-skilled p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-roots-text mb-3\">Public Space and Environmental Restoration</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-roots-text leading-relaxed\">Restoring ecological assets and shared community spaces.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 px-6 sm:px-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"mb-8 text-left\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-root-text tracking-tight mb-2\">Programs</h2></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-stretch\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-4 h-full bg-white p-4 border border-[#d9d9d9]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><button class=\"w-full text-left px-4 py-3.5 transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center justify-between group cursor-pointer bg-[#FEF9F1] border font-semibold\" style=\"border-color:#DC3B83;color:#1a1a1a\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full border-2 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shrink-0 border-transparent\" style=\"background-color:#DC3B83\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white\"></div></div><span class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-snug\">Community Development Project, Devanahalli</span></div></button><button class=\"w-full text-left px-4 py-3.5 transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center justify-between group cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 border border-transparent text-root-text\" style=\"border-color:transparent\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full border-2 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shrink-0 border-gray-300\" style=\"background-color:transparent\"></div><span class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-snug\">Community Development Project, Hosur</span></div></button></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-8 h-full bg-white border border-[#d9d9d9] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-100 pb-5 mb-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-root-text\">Community Development Project, Devanahalli</h3></div><div class=\"space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#4A4749] font-light mb-6\"><p>A multi-sector community development programme in Devanahalli Taluk, Bengaluru Rural, Karnataka.</p><p>The project supports education, primary healthcare, livestock care, disability inclusion, rural infrastructure, environmental initiatives, and technology-enabled skilling.</p><p>Key interventions include student scholarships, a community clinic, animal health camps, assistive mobility support, plantation drives, and VR-based training at GTTC College.</p><p>The programme has supported 30 students through scholarships, conducted 6 animal health camps, distributed 8 battery-operated tricycles, and created community assets including a centre in Polanahalli and a 12-metre high mast light in Channahalli.</p></div><div class=\"pt-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-roots-text mb-3\">Location(s)</div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><span class=\"text-xs px-4 py-2.5 text-white\" style=\"background-color:#DC3B83\">Devanahalli Taluk</span><span class=\"text-xs px-4 py-2.5 text-white\" style=\"background-color:#DC3B83\">Bengaluru Rural</span><span class=\"text-xs px-4 py-2.5 text-white\" style=\"background-color:#DC3B83\">Karnataka</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-7 gap-3\"><div class=\"group relative h-28 sm:h-32 overflow-hi